  "text": "Fourknocks is an Irish mythological site. Within the monuments left by the megalith builders of the Irish midlands, it is famed for size. Other passage graves let in only a couple of people through their inner rooms. The mound at Fourknocks holds many dozens without trouble. Its lintels carry zigzag carvings.",
